Route110_TrickHousePuzzle4_Text_H0_0::
	.string "It's too much bother to think this\n"
	.string "out. I only wanted to battle!$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle4_Text_H0_1::
	.string "Even though I lost, I still like\n"
	.string "battling the best!$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle4_Text_H0_2::
	.string "Wouldn't you agree? You would go\n"
	.string "anywhere if TRAINERS were there.$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle4_Text_H1_0::
	.string "The TRICK HOUSE is getting trickier,\n"
	.string "isn't it?$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle4_Text_H1_1::
	.string "Aaak!$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle4_Text_H1_2::
	.string "Has anyone made it to the end?$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle4_Text_H2_0::
	.string "Heh! Boulders like this, I can brush\n"
	.string "aside with one finger!$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle4_Text_H2_1::
	.string "I can push boulders, but I can't\n"
	.string "solve the puzzle…$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle4_Text_H2_2::
	.string "It's not good enough to be brawny…\n"
	.string "You have to use your head. Be\l"
	.string "brainy!$"

@ BEGIN PATCH (tools/hoenn_import/patches)
Route110_TrickHousePuzzle4_Text_CoraIntro::
    .string "Careful of the floor. Some of it\n"
    .string "isn't.$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle4_Text_CoraDefeat::
    .string "The floor got me too, once.$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle4_Text_CoraPostBattle::
    .string "Where the boards look darker,\n"
    .string "step round.$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle4_Text_PaulaIntro::
    .string "He digs holes and calls it\n"
    .string "architecture.$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle4_Text_PaulaDefeat::
    .string "Dug in, dug out.$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle4_Text_PaulaPostBattle::
    .string "Fall through and you start the\n"
    .string "room again. Ask me how I know.$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle4_Text_YujiIntro::
    .string "Two of us at once. House rules,\n"
    .string "not mine.$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle4_Text_YujiDefeat::
    .string "Both of us and still not enough.$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle4_Text_YujiPostBattle::
    .string "The scroll is past the boulders.\n"
    .string "Push, don't squeeze.$"

